  "title": "Sausage Stuffed Mushrooms I",
  "description": "These sausage and cream cheese stuffed mushrooms will be the hit of any party. Every time I make them everybody wants the recipe. This is the first time I've shared with such a big crowd. Enjoy!",
  "authors": [
